e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1xfAz7QlPOkQ7kNvwF2iHAj&_nc_oc=AdqrjgeRs4Fv4YH3EaY-CZHzzA5fgC0pt5727fkL7s49-kfohV8AK6iYPhpCuCD5v5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0HWy00NeFT2KC--uSWZ8ajZvBiGMnvPlTwV8ie8Brm0g&oe=69D63739"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aHC3akZXnZkQ7kNvwHslnxR&_nc_oc=Adqphdxz5Kf7CnkHKTdA_z6Aftz-oYjBk3wT7h5XcvZr8K2d3BZ9D7lgxrn9u0VyzcU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2CXOohmaARKwKwu6gEDi0iXazG6usdMFOH-pbqeLY1zA&oe=69D646D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TNBAIf-7rDgQ7kNvwHfbKgi&_nc_oc=AdqpVGY6LXkfJUzjceq4nk0avX5cxI-qap5rbWd3-qERFyU6_vj3WNlrjwnc97Sa9BM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1Nkh7MPDCWluLpI7SnTgFcVU3_JHhuiqN3HcioCfL4cA&oe=69D6527B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2slz5N2R3IUQ7kNvwGMzXcU&_nc_oc=AdqpvH6KzMpKGwjWCT8JiLorPfmV9xU82r6DhuHxeQ-ZrMnJWjfWmLgALVUqRqPPt0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0YnYGNDDY23wHY5pN4t2xtHj-EPq5RgfwTArKnV1volw&oe=69D653CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g4dnib97vD4Q7kNvwGcBeFv&_nc_oc=AdoCROjoCH9__s0uRdD1F8Kb9pkwy4IbfX2vslBfBnFgxpBEVDs8nryY84Xbogy0zag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1-ZNq8H4i_XXKWz2iStEn_5ezIXnA_zF_uSkDs-GX0uw&oe=69D63CFE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se